
:: The WING channels need to have connections set in place to indicate the source for 
:: the channel.  This is done by a Group designation and a number designation within the group.  
:: See the WING OSC manual for details, but for example,
::  a Channel connection can be from any of these groups
::  OFF, LCL, AUX, A, B, C, SC, USB, CRD, MOD, PLAY, AES, USR, OSC, BUS, MAIN, MTX with a number from 1-64.  
:: Likewise for an AUX.  

:: set myCONNVar.JoeMic.type=B
:: set myCONNVar.JoeMic.num=1